  "notes": "After the defense takes the ♥A, and switches to diamonds, South's only possible losers are in the club suit. If South draws all of the trumps, he will go down anytime clubs break 4-1.\n\nSouth can give himself an extra chance to make the contract by testing clubs after drawing only 2 rounds of trump. If both defenders follow to 2 rounds of clubs, South can draw the last trump and easily take the balance of the tricks.\n\nThe recommended line is critical when the defender with 4 clubs also has length in spades. In this case, South can cash a third round of clubs and ruff a club in the dummy.\n\nSouth's hand will now be high. South can draw the last trump and take the rest of the tricks.",
  "commentary_paragraphs": [
    "After the defense takes the ♥A, and switches to diamonds, South's only possible losers are in the club suit. If South draws all of the trumps, he will go down anytime clubs break 4-1.",
    "South can give himself an extra chance to make the contract by testing clubs after drawing only 2 rounds of trump. If both defenders follow to 2 rounds of clubs, South can draw the last trump and easily take the balance of the tricks.",
    "The recommended line is critical when the defender with 4 clubs also has length in spades. In this case, South can cash a third round of clubs and ruff a club in the dummy.",
    "South's hand will now be high. South can draw the last trump and take the rest of the tricks."
  ],
